<?xpacket begin="ï»¿" id="W5M0MpCehiHzreSzNTczkc9d"?>
<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x="adobe:ns:meta/">
  <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">hang tight (all you)</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;High school is already tough enough as it is. Having a crush on your best friend just complicates things.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Realizing you might be gay, well....that's probably a sign the universe hates you or something.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;or;;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Adora and Catra throughout the years as Adora struggles to come to terms with who she is in an environment that's not so encouraging. Including herself.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>TechnoSkittles</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
      </dc:creator>
      <dc:subject>
        <rdf:Bag>
          <rdf:li>Fanworks</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Teen And Up Audiences</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>She-Ra and the Princesses of Power (2018)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora/Catra (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Catra (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Scorpia (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Original Characters</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Pining</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Mutual Pining</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Alternate Universe - Modern Setting</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Alternate Universe - High School</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>adora has kinda bitchy friends</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>catra is a lesbian through and through in this</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Sexual Tension</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Masturbation</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Underage Masturbation</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Underage Drinking</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Underage Drug Use</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>So basically just high schoolers being high schoolers</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Alcohol</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Recreational Drug Use</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>they smoke the maree-ju-wannas</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>but yeah no for real there's weed</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>but just a brief mention at one point</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>the alcohol is a bit more prominent in places</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>and even that's not too bad</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>also the masturbation isn't explicit either</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>but heavily implied</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Homophobia</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Internalized Homophobia</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora has a cover</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>there's also a few other things that I'm not sure how to warn against in summary</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>so just read with discretion</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>it's nothing too bad I swear</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>just idk....be careful?</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>if it's not listed here you should be fine but I just wanna cover most of my bases</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>NO ONE DIES IN THIS ONE I SWEAR</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>I PROMISE ON MY COPY OF KINGDOM HEARTS 3</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>F/F</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Choose Not To Use Archive Warnings</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Bag>
      </dc:subject>
